545
00:26:57,047 --> 00:26:58,131
Go, man! Just go check it!

546
00:27:20,214 --> 00:27:21,755
"Isn't one hand enough, Sivagami?"

547
00:27:21,756 --> 00:27:23,588
He's our court's very own Nasser
from Baahubali.

548
00:27:23,589 --> 00:27:24,755
It's a crumbling old building.

549
00:27:24,756 --> 00:27:26,046
Touch anything
and it could fall apart at any time.

550
00:27:26,047 --> 00:27:27,839
