♪ With fireworks raging,
burning in wrath ♪

1454
01:22:19,506 --> 01:22:22,089
♪ Lord Karuppan arrives,
don't block his path ♪

1455
01:22:41,297 --> 01:22:44,338
Our archaic court must transform into a
high-tech hub like a Google or Apple office.

1456
01:22:44,339 --> 01:22:47,213
As for lawyers who lie for a living...
their mouths should be twisted and broken.

1457
01:22:47,214 --> 01:22:50,756
Every pending case must be settled,
erased as if they never even existed.

1458
01:23:07,797 --> 01:23:09,305
I asked You for so many boons...

1459
01:23:09,756 --> 01:23:10,919
but You didn't grant a single one.

1460
01:23:11,881 --> 01:23:13,751
And now You hand me this
bandana-wrapped case file.

1461
01:23:26,553 --> 01:23:28,346
No one was willing to touch
my case all this time.

1462
01:23:28,672 --> 01:23:31,172
Then suddenly, a stranger
comes forward to help me.

1463
01:23:31,506 --> 01:23:33,601
And now you're saying
you'll appear for me.

1464
01:23:34,006 --> 01:23:35,321
I don't understand
what's going on.

1465
01:23:35,631 --> 01:23:36,881
Just God things!

1466
01:23:37,547 --> 01:23:39,506
Alright, tell me about your case.

1467
01:23:41,339 --> 01:23:43,296
When V.M. Pandian was the Law Minister,

1468
01:23:43,297 --> 01:23:45,421
I served as his personal secretary.

1469
01:23:45,422 --> 01:23:47,088
Many times, in his presence...

1470
01:23:47,089 --> 01:23:48,838
I've felt deeply uncomfortable.

1471
01:23:49,172 --> 01:23:51,171
I kept telling myself
I was just overthinking it...

1472
01:23:51,172 --> 01:23:53,672
suspecting a man my father's age
for no reason.

1473
01:23:54,131 --> 01:23:55,144
But one day...

1474
01:23:55,422 --> 01:23:57,422
when we went to Delhi for work...

1475
01:23:59,297 --> 01:24:00,844
I didn't know what to do.

1476
01:24:01,006 --> 01:24:03,630
I finally gathered the courage
to go to the police station.

1477
01:24:03,631 --> 01:24:05,421
Not only did they refuse
to take my complaint...

1478
01:24:05,422 --> 01:24:08,521
they threatened me and forced
me to return to work for him.

1479
01:24:08,881 --> 01:24:10,796
It was only after his party
lost the election...

1480
01:24:10,797 --> 01:24:13,091
that I could finally
see a lawyer and file the case.

1481
01:24:13,631 --> 01:24:16,505
Just my luck. I ended up with
a lawyer from their own team.

1482
01:24:16,506 --> 01:24:18,040
They tried every trick in the book...

1483
01:24:18,339 --> 01:24:19,839
to force me to withdraw the case.

1484
01:24:20,506 --> 01:24:23,048
Since these people are dangerous,
no one is willing to take my case.

1485
01:24:23,631 --> 01:24:26,043
You're saying you will...
are you sure you're okay with it?

1486
01:24:26,797 --> 01:24:28,796
If I can get justice for
even one person like you,

1487
01:24:28,797 --> 01:24:32,464
it will give so many other women
the courage to come forward.

1488
01:24:32,756 --> 01:24:33,755
Trust me.

1489
01:24:33,756 --> 01:24:35,797
Have faith.
Let's fight this.

1490
01:25:05,881 --> 01:25:08,546
CC 2810
V.M. Pandian

1491
01:25:08,547 --> 01:25:14,672
[crowd cheering for their leader]

1492
01:25:15,047 --> 01:25:17,172
Long live our leader!

1493
01:25:17,631 --> 01:25:18,358
Silence.

1494
01:25:19,631 --> 01:25:20,871
Stay quiet.
Otherwise, I'll send you out.

1495
01:25:21,631 --> 01:25:22,630
What's your prayer, Preethi?

1496
01:25:22,631 --> 01:25:25,671
My Lord, while Mr. V.M. Pandian
was serving as Law Minister,

1497
01:25:25,672 --> 01:25:28,046
he behaved inappropriately
with my client, Kanmani,

1498
01:25:28,047 --> 01:25:31,006
and threatened her with dire
consequences if she spoke out.

1499
01:25:31,881 --> 01:25:34,797
Under BNS Section 75
for the offence of sexual harassment...

1500
01:25:34,964 --> 01:25:39,421
and BNS Section 308, Sub-section (2)
for blackmailing my client,

1501
01:25:39,422 --> 01:25:42,339
I request that the accused,
Mr. V.M. Pandian, be formally charged.

1502
01:25:42,547 --> 01:25:43,547
That's all, My Lord!

1503
01:25:43,881 --> 01:25:45,297
Baby Kannan, any questions?

1504
01:25:46,714 --> 01:25:47,281
My Lord...

1505
01:25:48,797 --> 01:25:50,506
Several questions arise in this case.

1506
01:25:50,756 --> 01:25:52,213
And once those questions
are answered,

1507
01:25:52,214 --> 01:25:54,671
it will be clear that this case
is nothing but a publicity stunt.

1508
01:25:54,672 --> 01:25:56,255
- With your permission.
- Proceed.

1509
01:25:56,256 --> 01:25:57,631
Thank you, My Lord!

1510
01:25:58,506 --> 01:25:59,505
Miss Kanmani.

1511
01:25:59,506 --> 01:26:01,214
When do you claim
this incident took place?

1512
01:26:02,131 --> 01:26:04,130
November 15, 2018.

1513
01:26:04,131 --> 01:26:05,672
And when did you
file the complaint?

1514
01:26:05,881 --> 01:26:07,130
A year ago.

1515
01:26:07,131 --> 01:26:08,380
Not "a year ago."

1516
01:26:08,381 --> 01:26:10,796
Five years after
the alleged incident.

1517
01:26:10,797 --> 01:26:12,964
- But he threatened me...
- Hello, hello!

1518
01:26:13,297 --> 01:26:14,631
Answer only what you're asked.

1519
01:26:15,464 --> 01:26:17,154
During those five years,
did you have an accident?

1520
01:26:17,756 --> 01:26:18,463
No!

1521
01:26:18,464 --> 01:26:19,921
Any injuries
to the back of your head?

1522
01:26:19,922 --> 01:26:20,377
No!

1523
01:26:20,922 --> 01:26:23,338
Or like in the movie Ghajini, do you
suffer from any kind of memory loss?

1524
01:26:23,339 --> 01:26:24,152
Objection, My Lord!

1525
01:26:24,464 --> 01:26:26,713
Why? Let him finish
asking his questions.

1526
01:26:26,714 --> 01:26:27,478
Overruled.

1527
01:26:29,131 --> 01:26:29,966
Thank you, My Lord.

1528
01:26:31,256 --> 01:26:33,265
So, it took you five years to realise
that what happened was a crime?

1529
01:26:34,339 --> 01:26:35,797
Point may be noted, My Lord!

1530
01:26:36,797 --> 01:26:38,963
Now, as per your complaint,
where did this incident take place?

1531
01:26:38,964 --> 01:26:40,338
At his residence in Delhi.

1532
01:26:40,339 --> 01:26:42,130
- On which floor?
- The second floor.

1533
01:26:42,131 --> 01:26:45,588
My Lord, my client suffers from arthritis
and has had surgeries on both knees.

1534
01:26:45,589 --> 01:26:47,922
So, he cannot climb stairs,
and he's advised not to.

1535
01:26:48,381 --> 01:26:50,588
How could he have done this on the second
floor of a house with no elevator?

1536
01:26:50,589 --> 01:26:52,964
I have already produced the supporting
medical certificate, My Lord.

1537
01:26:55,964 --> 01:26:58,505
My Lord, I seek your permission
to play an audio file.

1538
01:26:58,506 --> 01:27:00,047
- Proceed.
- Play it.

1539
01:27:00,256 --> 01:27:02,838
- Sir, this is Kanmani speaking.
- Tell me, dear.

1540
01:27:02,839 --> 01:27:04,547
I haven't been able
to sleep all night.

1541
01:27:04,714 --> 01:27:06,088
I can't stop thinking about you.

1542
01:27:06,089 --> 01:27:07,464
Can we get on a video call?

1543
01:27:08,214 --> 01:27:09,839
Is the voice in this audio yours?

1544
01:27:10,131 --> 01:27:11,755
I never made such a call, sir.

1545
01:27:11,756 --> 01:27:14,631
Hello! Answer only the question asked.
Whose voice is this?

1546
01:27:14,839 --> 01:27:15,838
It's my voice.

1547
01:27:15,839 --> 01:27:17,714
- But this call...
- Point may be noted, My Lord!

1548
01:27:22,672 --> 01:27:24,756
We have heard enough
falsehoods in this case.

1549
01:27:24,922 --> 01:27:26,463
Now I will tell you the truth
of what really happened.

1550
01:27:26,464 --> 01:27:27,364
Only the truth!

1551
01:27:27,756 --> 01:27:31,797
Only the truth!

1552
01:27:32,089 --> 01:27:35,047
[voice distorts]

1553
01:27:43,881 --> 01:27:46,369
Yes, My Lord.
After remaining silent for five years,

1554
01:27:46,672 --> 01:27:49,159
why has she suddenly come
forward and filed this case, My Lord?

1555
01:27:49,297 --> 01:27:52,047
Because my client was a Minister
in power... it was out of pure FEAR!

1556
01:28:05,464 --> 01:28:06,547
Did I say fear?

1557
01:28:07,881 --> 01:28:09,061
Did I just say fear?

1558
01:28:09,339 --> 01:28:11,589
Sorry, My Lord!
Correct... Mis...

1559
01:28:18,756 --> 01:28:20,881
That wasn't a slip of the tongue...
That was the TRUTH!

1560
01:28:25,131 --> 01:28:26,463
My Lord! Everything's okay.

1561
01:28:26,464 --> 01:28:28,172
Okay, okay!
I'm ready now!

1562
01:28:29,256 --> 01:28:30,005
Ready!

1563
01:28:30,006 --> 01:28:33,255
After having said nothing all these years,
if she's suddenly filing a case like this...

1564
01:28:33,256 --> 01:28:35,505
was this case filed for publicity?

1565
01:28:35,506 --> 01:28:36,547
NO, My Lord!

1566
01:28:40,047 --> 01:28:42,214
Was this case filed for publicity?
NO, My Lord!

1567
01:28:44,964 --> 01:28:47,506
No... this case... was filed...
for publicity... NOT AT ALL!

1568
01:28:49,797 --> 01:28:51,630
As for those lawyers who live off lies...

1569
01:28:51,631 --> 01:28:54,713
From now on, they should stammer
the moment they try to lie in court...

1570
01:28:54,714 --> 01:28:55,711
and fail miserably!!

1571
01:28:57,506 --> 01:28:58,755
Inside the court...

1572
01:28:58,756 --> 01:29:02,256
the lawyer is unable to lie.

1573
01:29:05,339 --> 01:29:07,214
- Baby Kannan, are you okay?
- No, My Lord!

1574
01:29:08,464 --> 01:29:10,588
- Shall we adjourn for another date?
- Yes, My Lord!

1575
01:29:10,589 --> 01:29:12,381
I don't know what's wrong, My Lord.
My tongue keeps slipping!

1576
01:29:13,297 --> 01:29:16,881
- This case is posted to 13th of next--
- No, no, no, My Lord!

1577
01:29:17,922 --> 01:29:18,986
Shall we proceed now?

1578
01:29:19,672 --> 01:29:20,672
Yes!

1579
01:29:21,172 --> 01:29:22,492
YES! YES!

1580
01:29:23,131 --> 01:29:24,671
One minute.
Let me test my speech.

1581
01:29:24,672 --> 01:29:29,921
[Raps the song
from "Ethir Neechal" perfectly]

1582
01:29:29,922 --> 01:29:30,859
Baby Kannan!

1583
01:29:31,631 --> 01:29:33,296
- WHAT?
- Water!

1584
01:29:33,297 --> 01:29:35,214
Water! Water!

1585
01:29:39,339 --> 01:29:40,380
What... What...!

1586
01:29:40,381 --> 01:29:41,589
Please, have some water.

1587
01:29:47,214 --> 01:29:47,844
My Lord!

1588
01:29:49,714 --> 01:29:51,881
I need to ask a few questions
to Mr. V.M. Pandian.

1589
01:29:54,047 --> 01:29:54,547
Proceed.

1590
01:29:56,714 --> 01:29:59,097
Mr. V.M. Pandian,
do you suffer from arthritis?

1591
01:29:59,631 --> 01:30:00,247
I do.

1592
01:30:05,131 --> 01:30:06,297
Baby!!!

1593
01:30:07,547 --> 01:30:08,588
He doesn't!

1594
01:30:08,589 --> 01:30:09,589
I do!

1595
01:30:09,714 --> 01:30:12,130
- He doesn't!
- I do!

1596
01:30:12,131 --> 01:30:13,338
NO! NO!

1597
01:30:13,339 --> 01:30:15,546
Hey, didn't we just submit
the medical certificate?

1598
01:30:15,547 --> 01:30:18,380
I forged that medical certificate,
My Lord! Don't you know that?

1599
01:30:18,381 --> 01:30:21,296
He's climbed up to your second-floor
chamber to meet you so many times!

1600
01:30:21,297 --> 01:30:22,463
Wait... I'll prove it right now!

1601
01:30:22,464 --> 01:30:24,046
He's never had knee surgery.

1602
01:30:24,047 --> 01:30:25,380
There won't even be a scar, My Lord!

1603
01:30:25,381 --> 01:30:27,463
Look! Look at this!
See, no scar!

1604
01:30:27,464 --> 01:30:30,421
If he has arthritis, he can't climb
stairs at home or here in court.

1605
01:30:30,422 --> 01:30:32,631
He's cheating, My Lord!
Oh my god! Oh boy!

1606
01:30:33,637 --> 01:30:34,390
Silence!

1607
01:30:38,797 --> 01:30:40,796
I'd like to move on to the next piece
of evidence, the audio tape.

1608
01:30:40,797 --> 01:30:41,963
What? What about it?

1609
01:30:41,964 --> 01:30:43,296
Kanmani admitted
it was her voice, right?

1610
01:30:43,297 --> 01:30:48,547
[fake voice singing a Tamil song]

1611
01:30:52,672 --> 01:30:54,143
So, did he really
sing this song, My Lord?

1612
01:30:55,089 --> 01:30:57,880
With today's AI technology, anyone's voice
can be replicated by anyone.

1613
01:30:57,881 --> 01:31:00,671
So, I had their IT department
manufacture this voice on my orders!

1614
01:31:00,672 --> 01:31:02,256
Are you saying your
own evidence is fake?

1615
01:31:02,381 --> 01:31:05,214
Yes, My Lord.
Fake, illegal, bogus, fabricated.

1616
01:31:05,756 --> 01:31:07,296
As per the rules,
you should have demanded

1617
01:31:07,297 --> 01:31:08,796
a Section 63 BSA certificate
for digital evidence.

1618
01:31:08,797 --> 01:31:10,880
I should have given it.
But you didn't ask, and I didn't give it.

1619
01:31:10,881 --> 01:31:11,963
Point may be...

1620
01:31:11,964 --> 01:31:13,338
...noted, My Lord!

1621
01:31:13,339 --> 01:31:15,588
Baby Kannan! You are
making a mockery of this court.

1622
01:31:15,589 --> 01:31:17,463
- Do you realise who you're talking to?
- Yes, My Lord.

1623
01:31:17,464 --> 01:31:19,755
Back when he was the Kumbakonam MLA,
you were his personal lawyer...

1624
01:31:19,756 --> 01:31:21,421
and it was only
through his recommendation

1625
01:31:21,422 --> 01:31:23,380
that you're sitting in that chair
as the Chief Judge!

1626
01:31:23,381 --> 01:31:25,630
That's exactly who
I'm talking to, My Lord.

1627
01:31:25,631 --> 01:31:27,421
Baby Kannan, I'll take contempt action.

1628
01:31:27,422 --> 01:31:29,422
Remove him from the court.
Police!

1629
01:31:29,964 --> 01:31:31,588
You have no idea
what you are about to face.

1630
01:31:31,589 --> 01:31:32,921
But I can't control my mouth!

1631
01:31:32,922 --> 01:31:34,130
Throw him out!

1632
01:31:34,131 --> 01:31:35,381
This is terrifying!

1633
01:31:36,464 --> 01:31:37,964
None of these are lies.
Let go of me!

1634
01:31:38,547 --> 01:31:40,338
I know what you'll do to me, My Lord.

1635
01:31:40,339 --> 01:31:42,839
But you can't touch me...
I'll finish you!

1636
01:31:45,131 --> 01:31:47,046
I have the call recordings!
I'll send them straight to Vigilance!

1637
01:31:47,047 --> 01:31:48,797
I've got you by the throat, My Lord!

1638
01:31:53,381 --> 01:31:55,088
Hey! Is this some kind of act?

1639
01:31:55,089 --> 01:31:56,421
You were lying so well till now.

1640
01:31:56,422 --> 01:31:58,046
Give me one more chance, sir.

1641
01:31:58,047 --> 01:32:00,505
This has never happened before...
I don't understand what's going on!

1642
01:32:00,506 --> 01:32:02,755
♪ This is God mode ♪

1643
01:32:02,756 --> 01:32:05,130
Does the Judge have
any ties to VM Pandian?

1644
01:32:05,131 --> 01:32:06,588
When will the call recordings
be made public?

1645
01:32:06,589 --> 01:32:08,421
♪ This is God mode ♪

1646
01:32:08,422 --> 01:32:10,338
Acting as if you're some Harishchandra
