1667
01:33:18,756 --> 01:33:20,088
Well... God just showed up.

1668
01:33:20,089 --> 01:33:21,546
This is my territory.

1669
01:33:21,547 --> 01:33:22,755
My court!

1670
01:33:22,756 --> 01:33:25,630
From now on, nobody will make a move
here without dealing with me first.

1671
01:33:25,631 --> 01:33:27,137
Walk away while you still can.

1672
01:33:28,172 --> 01:33:28,903
Baby,

1673
01:33:29,631 --> 01:33:31,023
Daddy's home!

1674
01:33:36,922 --> 01:33:39,921
♪ Shall we blast a thousand crackers fast?
Shall we pile cigars in heaps so vast? ♪

1675
01:33:39,922 --> 01:33:43,046
♪ Goat meat, anchovies, and kingfish,
Shall we stack them high for Him to relish? ♪

1676
