Even if you use your powers
to clear the backlog,

1759
01:38:59,797 --> 01:39:02,297
new cases will just keep piling up.

1760
01:39:02,422 --> 01:39:03,671
Even as we speak,

1761
01:39:03,672 --> 01:39:05,422
ten new cases
have probably been filed.

1762
01:39:05,547 --> 01:39:08,089
It's like trying to clear trash
while people keep dumping more.

1763
01:39:08,589 --> 01:39:09,589
What are you going to do?

1764
01:39:09,839 --> 01:39:13,214
["Karu Karu Karuppayi" plays]

1765
01:39:19,922 --> 01:39:20,893
Anna, I'm leaving.

1766
01:39:21,172 --> 01:39:21,959
Bye, Akka!

1767
01:39:22,506 --> 01:39:23,279
Bye, sweetie!

1768
01:39:27,006 --> 01:39:28,034
Sir, the shop is closed.

1769
01:39:28,381 --> 01:39:30,006
Chocolate coffee!

1770
01:39:30,256 --> 01:39:32,213
Sir, the sign is up.
We're closed for the day.

1771
01:39:32,214 --> 01:39:33,881
Chocolate coffee!

1772
01:39:34,172 --> 01:39:36,213
Look at this, Anna!
He is refusing to leave.

1773
01:39:36,214 --> 01:39:37,255
I am leaving, Anna!

1774
01:39:37,256 --> 01:39:38,171
Hey!

1775
01:39:38,172 --> 01:39:39,421
Look at this, Anna!

1776
01:39:39,422 --> 01:39:40,631
Hey, let go of my hand!

1777
01:39:42,381 --> 01:39:43,422
Hey, my hand!

1778
01:39:43,922 --> 01:39:45,088
Is that a gun?

1779
01:39:45,089 --> 01:39:47,046
He has a gun, Anna!

1780
01:39:47,047 --> 01:39:48,463
Chocolate coffee!

1781
01:39:48,464 --> 01:39:49,881
Hey, take your hand off.

1782
01:39:50,214 --> 01:39:51,630
Hey, let go!

1783
01:39:51,631 --> 01:39:53,047
- Chocolate coffee!
- Anna!

1784
01:39:53,339 --> 01:39:55,214
Anna! Anna!

1785
01:40:08,672 --> 01:40:10,199
Sister, I'm sorry.

1786
01:40:10,756 --> 01:40:12,179
These lenses are giving me
a splitting headache!

1787
01:40:12,547 --> 01:40:14,046
It's fine if you
don't have chocolate coffee.

1788
01:40:14,047 --> 01:40:15,296
At least get me
some filter coffee.

1789
01:40:15,297 --> 01:40:16,042
Anna!

1790
01:40:16,422 --> 01:40:18,046
Were you begging this
much just for filter coffee?

1791
01:40:18,047 --> 01:40:18,546
Yes!

1792
01:40:18,547 --> 01:40:20,380
Wait, brother. I'll get you
a special "LEO" coffee.

1793
01:40:20,381 --> 01:40:21,546
You are very kind, sister.

1794
01:40:21,547 --> 01:40:24,172
- Make it extra strong, dear.
- Anna, one strong LEO coffee!

1795
01:40:25,589 --> 01:40:27,214
What just happened?
I don't get it.

1796
01:40:28,006 --> 01:40:29,698
That guy would've misbehaved
with that girl...

1797
01:40:30,089 --> 01:40:32,005
and four or five of his friends
would've joined in too.

1798
01:40:32,797 --> 01:40:34,296
Then my friend,
the coffee shop owner,

1799
01:40:34,297 --> 01:40:35,880
