added another case to the list.

1800
01:40:35,881 --> 01:40:39,046
[theme from "Leo"]
♪ Leo ♪

1801
01:40:39,047 --> 01:40:41,255
♪ Badass ♪
♪ Mr. Leo Das is a badass ♪

1802
01:40:41,256 --> 01:40:43,464
♪ Leo ♪

1803
01:40:44,297 --> 01:40:45,713
He never committed the murders.

1804
01:40:45,714 --> 01:40:48,297
Which means... that case
won't ever be filed now, will it?

1805
01:40:48,756 --> 01:40:50,631
A case is filed only when
a crime is committed.

1806
01:40:50,756 --> 01:40:52,921
From this moment on, no crime
will happen in my territory.

1807
01:40:52,922 --> 01:40:54,672
So, no new cases will ever arise.

1808
01:40:54,881 --> 01:40:55,881
Oh, wow!

1809
01:40:57,672 --> 01:40:59,349
You're asking for an important file,

1810
01:40:59,881 --> 01:41:02,422
