to any of my messages.

1811
01:41:05,006 --> 01:41:06,421
Where is your house in Chennai, dear?

1812
01:41:06,422 --> 01:41:08,172
Sir!
Stop it, sir.

1813
01:41:08,589 --> 01:41:09,838
We've brought biryani, sir.

1814
01:41:09,839 --> 01:41:10,880
Biryani?

1815
01:41:10,881 --> 01:41:12,756
- Yes, sir.
- Why didn't you say that earlier?

1816
01:41:12,881 --> 01:41:14,796
- How many pieces of meat?
- Three pieces.

1817
01:41:14,797 --> 01:41:15,881
Show me!

1818
01:41:37,506 --> 01:41:38,124
Sir!

1819
01:42:08,714 --> 01:42:10,421
Place all the children's
clothes over there.

1820
01:42:10,422 --> 01:42:12,255
- Place all the adults' clothes here.
- Okay, Anna.

1821
01:42:12,256 --> 01:42:13,380
Hey!

1822
01:42:13,381 --> 01:42:15,172
- No, Anna. Please spare me.
- You!!

1823
01:42:15,547 --> 01:42:16,714
Spare me, Anna!

1824
01:42:18,547 --> 01:42:19,017
Anna!

1825
01:42:19,672 --> 01:42:20,921
Have some tender
coconut water, Anna!

1826
01:42:20,922 --> 01:42:22,880
Natural water.
Full of potassium.

1827
01:42:22,881 --> 01:42:23,881
Drink it, Anna!

1828
01:42:28,131 --> 01:42:30,213
♪ Ten rupees extra per bottle ♪

1829
01:42:30,214 --> 01:42:30,734
Brother!

1830
01:42:31,839 --> 01:42:33,664
You've paid ten rupees
extra for the bottle.

1831
01:42:34,297 --> 01:42:34,992
Please take it back.

1832
01:42:36,464 --> 01:42:38,547
- Ten rupees?
- Here's the bill.

1833
01:42:38,714 --> 01:42:39,351
What?

1834
01:42:40,797 --> 01:42:41,674
A bill?

1835
01:42:47,297 --> 01:42:49,546
The entire Seven Wells territory
is completely sealed.

1836
01:42:49,547 --> 01:42:52,421
Theft, murder, mugging, pickpocketing,
forgery, corruption...

1837
01:42:52,422 --> 01:42:53,713
Not one of these crimes
is happening anymore.

1838
01:42:53,714 --> 01:42:56,964
Across all 17 police stations here,
not a single case is being filed anywhere!

1839
01:43:03,756 --> 01:43:06,213
What's going on, Kumaran sir?
Not a single case registered all week?

1840
01:43:06,214 --> 01:43:09,171
A case can only be registered
if a new crime is committed.

1841
01:43:09,172 --> 01:43:10,238
Nothing's happening.

1842
01:43:12,922 --> 01:43:14,129
What is this?
The FLAMES game?

1843
01:43:14,797 --> 01:43:17,630
I wanted to live as an Inspector.
Didn't work out.

1844
01:43:17,631 --> 01:43:20,130
Now I'm trying to live
with an Inspector.

1845
01:43:20,131 --> 01:43:21,214
Good idea, right?

1846
01:43:26,964 --> 01:43:28,605
My hand literally flinches
whenever I try to take a bribe.

1847
01:43:29,047 --> 01:43:30,565
Do something wrong,
and the punishment is instant!

1848
01:43:30,881 --> 01:43:32,338
Hey, what are you doing?

1849
01:43:32,339 --> 01:43:34,296
There have been
no new cases lately, right?

1850
01:43:34,297 --> 01:43:36,546
So they've started digging up all the
cold cases and fast-tracking them!

1851
01:43:36,547 --> 01:43:39,089
Lord Karuppan has taken over the court.
Commit a crime, and you're dead meat!

1852
01:43:47,214 --> 01:43:49,505
Ganesh sir? What are you
doing here eating curd rice?

1853
01:43:49,506 --> 01:43:51,046
Don't you usually only
dine at five-star hotels?

1854
01:43:51,047 --> 01:43:52,546
