Get lost!

1855
01:43:52,547 --> 01:43:53,839
Hats off, sir.
Nice meeting you.

1856
01:43:54,381 --> 01:43:56,506
Lord Karuppa!

1857
01:43:57,297 --> 01:43:59,464
Lord Karuppa!

1858
01:44:03,047 --> 01:44:04,269
I am your child too, aren't I?

1859
01:44:04,797 --> 01:44:06,296
I just told a lie without
even realising it!

1860
01:44:06,297 --> 01:44:07,631
If I ever lie again...

1861
01:44:08,172 --> 01:44:09,380
