1862
01:44:09,381 --> 01:44:11,172
I won't do anything
wrong anymore, Karuppa!

1863
01:44:11,297 --> 01:44:12,547
I won't take another bribe!

1864
01:44:12,839 --> 01:44:14,881
I'll never misbehave
with a girl again!

1865
01:44:15,131 --> 01:44:15,947
Oh God!

1866
01:44:16,756 --> 01:44:17,756
Forgive me.

1867
01:44:23,089 --> 01:44:24,463
This feels like magic!

1868
01:44:24,464 --> 01:44:26,921
Four thousand cases were
wrapped up in just ten days!

1869
01:44:26,922 --> 01:44:28,380
Since there are
no new cases coming in...

1870
01:44:28,381 --> 01:44:30,755
