every single old pending case.

1871
01:44:30,756 --> 01:44:32,756
All the wrongdoers
are absolutely terrified.

1872
01:44:33,047 --> 01:44:34,256
This is legendary!

1873
01:44:34,589 --> 01:44:36,464
All this is for my beloved fans out there!

1874
01:44:37,047 --> 01:44:40,172
Lord Karuppa!

1875
01:44:41,631 --> 01:44:43,380
Not a single case
is reaching the court.

1876
01:44:43,381 --> 01:44:45,089
But look at how crowded
the temple is.

1877
01:44:47,881 --> 01:44:49,383
A temple right in the middle
of the court compound...

1878
01:44:50,256 --> 01:44:51,351
It's a bit of a nuisance, isn't it?

1879
01:45:00,339 --> 01:45:02,963
Brother, we're all here
with the bulldozer.

1880
01:45:02,964 --> 01:45:04,992
The police have arrived, too.
I'll call you once it's over.

1881
01:45:05,464 --> 01:45:06,245
Okay.

1882
01:45:09,381 --> 01:45:10,797
Hey, who's that?

1883
01:45:11,047 --> 01:45:13,297
Lying there beneath Lord Karuppu
like he owns the place.

1884
01:45:13,422 --> 01:45:15,256
Hey, that's that
lawyer from Madurai.

1885
01:45:15,422 --> 01:45:16,922
Give him a beating
and chase him off!

1886
01:45:43,297 --> 01:45:44,464
- Hey! Hey! Hey!
- Huh?

1887
01:45:45,422 --> 01:45:46,838
What on earth is this?

1888
01:45:46,839 --> 01:45:49,134
Suddenly, this place looks
like Bangkok's Walking Street!

1889
01:45:50,131 --> 01:45:51,756
Hey, chase him away!

1890
01:47:07,172 --> 01:47:08,713
♪ He's the one who smashed
your army down ♪

1891
