Lord Karuppa!

1894
01:47:17,089 --> 01:47:19,421
Forgive me, Lord Karuppa!

1895
01:47:19,422 --> 01:47:21,296
I think Karuppu has possessed
him to attack us!

1896
01:47:21,297 --> 01:47:23,756
He isn't possessed by Karuppu.
Karuppu himself is delivering the blows!

1897
