If you flip the mirror,
how's the auto going to run, Baby?

1933
01:49:12,297 --> 01:49:12,671
Hey!

1934
01:49:12,672 --> 01:49:15,631
Okay. Hands off the phone while driving.
Someone might crash into you.

1935
