Hello! Hello!

1936
01:49:23,297 --> 01:49:23,905
Hello!

1937
01:49:39,631 --> 01:49:43,546
Baby sir, I heard you ratted out
the Judge in open court?

1938
01:49:43,547 --> 01:49:45,713
That's why he has asked us
to finish you off!

1939
