we'll make it quick and painless.

1944
01:50:02,131 --> 01:50:03,506
Finish him.

1945
01:50:04,964 --> 01:50:07,589
Only if we kill this guy
will all our cases disappear.

1946
01:50:09,964 --> 01:50:11,464
Hey, don't do this!

1947
01:50:12,964 --> 01:50:14,214
Wait, don't!

1948
01:50:15,297 --> 01:50:16,422
Please, don't!

1949
01:50:23,631 --> 01:50:25,213
Good heavens! Our Lord!
What's happened to you?

1950
01:50:25,214 --> 01:50:27,130
Sir, how on earth
did you get hurt like this?

1951
01:50:27,131 --> 01:50:29,652
- Can't you be more careful?
- You're like a brother to us.

1952
01:50:30,547 --> 01:50:33,006
If something happens to you,
what will we do?

1953
01:50:33,214 --> 01:50:35,671
Quick, we have to get him to a hospital.
Lift him up, gently!

1954
01:50:35,672 --> 01:50:38,047
We aren't a team of four!
With you, we're a team of five!

1955
01:50:39,881 --> 01:50:41,047
Easy!

1956
01:50:41,297 --> 01:50:42,797
- Heave!
- Come on, brother!

1957
01:50:43,881 --> 01:50:46,505
- What are you guys doing?
- Don't you worry, sir. We've got you.

1958
01:50:46,506 --> 01:50:48,005
Come on, let's go to the hospital.

1959
01:50:48,006 --> 01:50:49,838
Hospital? Why are you
constantly switching sides?

1960
01:50:49,839 --> 01:50:51,714
What's wrong with you people?
I don't understand! Let me go!

1961
01:50:54,214 --> 01:50:55,380
Why the hell are
you carrying him?

1962
01:50:55,381 --> 01:50:57,630
Drop him! Kill him now!

1963
01:50:57,631 --> 01:50:59,047
I'll finish him myself!

1964
01:50:59,339 --> 01:51:00,630
You're like a younger brother to me.

1965
01:51:00,631 --> 01:51:01,713
Brother, my foot!

1966
01:51:01,714 --> 01:51:04,463
- You said we're a team of five!
- To hell with that!

1967
01:51:04,464 --> 01:51:06,631
- I'm your brother Baby Kannan!
- Shut your mouth, you loser!

1968
01:51:09,547 --> 01:51:11,047
Hey, let me go!

1969
01:51:11,172 --> 01:51:12,422
Don't let him escape!

1970
01:51:13,631 --> 01:51:15,796
I got you that factory
from the old couple, didn't I? Let me go!

1971
01:51:15,797 --> 01:51:17,172
And this is for that!

1972
01:51:20,881 --> 01:51:22,296
Hey, catch him! Catch him!

1973
01:51:22,297 --> 01:51:22,823
Catch!

1974
01:51:43,631 --> 01:51:47,047
Hack him to pieces and
make sure he's never found!

1975
01:51:58,089 --> 01:51:59,172
Oh no!

1976
01:51:59,672 --> 01:52:01,046
What happened, sir?

1977
01:52:01,047 --> 01:52:02,714
How did you get hurt so badly?

1978
01:52:03,631 --> 01:52:05,339
My God! What happened?

1979
01:52:05,464 --> 01:52:06,838
Sir, how on earth
did you get hurt like this?

1980
01:52:06,839 --> 01:52:08,171
Can't you be more careful?

1981
01:52:08,172 --> 01:52:09,796
You are like an
elder brother to us, sir!

1982
01:52:09,797 --> 01:52:13,130
If something were to happen to you,
who would we have left?

1983
01:52:13,131 --> 01:52:15,714
You are bleeding. Come, let's go
to the hospital immediately.

1984
01:52:20,672 --> 01:52:22,131
What are you thinking?
Come, sir.

1985
01:52:24,047 --> 01:52:25,380
This is my territory.

1986
01:52:25,381 --> 01:52:26,541
My court!

1987
01:52:26,714 --> 01:52:29,089
From now on, nobody will make a move
here without dealing with me first.

1988
01:52:37,922 --> 01:52:39,630
Please, sir,
let's get you to the hospital.

1989
01:52:39,631 --> 01:52:41,839
I'm not stopping
until you're in the morgue!

1990
01:52:41,964 --> 01:52:44,546
- What happened to your face?
- You sent them to kill me, didn't you?

1991
01:52:44,547 --> 01:52:45,755
And what are they doing?

1992
01:52:45,756 --> 01:52:47,463
Sir, you're bleeding
all over the place!

1993
01:52:47,464 --> 01:52:50,006
I'll hack you to pieces and
make sure you're never found!

1994
01:52:50,631 --> 01:52:52,365
Do you still think
I'm making all this up?

1995
01:52:53,256 --> 01:52:55,589
Come, Your Lordship.
Let me show you for yourself.

1996
01:53:02,881 --> 01:53:05,380
Countless problems have plagued
this court for years.

1997
01:53:05,381 --> 01:53:08,006
You never showed up then...
so why appear now?

1998
01:53:08,256 --> 01:53:09,756
Who said I never appeared?

1999
01:53:10,047 --> 01:53:11,749
You've only noticed me this time
because I chose to stand before you.

2000
01:53:12,922 --> 01:53:15,546
Every single day, so much injustice
unfolds right before your eyes.

2001
01:53:15,547 --> 01:53:17,172
It unfolds before yours, too.

2002
01:53:17,589 --> 01:53:18,588
And what have you done?

2003
01:53:18,589 --> 01:53:20,213
Mankind doesn't even
bother to help one another.

2004
01:53:20,214 --> 01:53:22,630
Yet, you dare complain
that God doesn't come to your rescue.

2005
01:53:22,631 --> 01:53:24,339
Sorry... I shouldn't have asked.

2006
01:53:26,631 --> 01:53:29,088
Hey hello! I already
said sorry, didn't I?

2007
01:53:29,089 --> 01:53:30,921
- Why are you doing this?
- It's not me.

2008
01:53:30,922 --> 01:53:31,964
Behind us!

2009
01:53:37,714 --> 01:53:38,964
Go on! Step on it!

2010
01:53:46,047 --> 01:53:48,297
Did you bring me all
this way just to show her?

2011
01:53:49,839 --> 01:53:51,131
Wait for some time, My Lord!

2012
01:53:54,631 --> 01:53:56,755
What is this, a security escort?
Get in front of her.

2013
01:53:56,756 --> 01:53:57,797
Hey, catch her!

2014
01:54:10,631 --> 01:54:12,256
Wait a minute!

2015
01:54:28,214 --> 01:54:29,464
Hit the brakes!

2016
01:54:43,131 --> 01:54:44,505
Hey, bring it on!

2017
01:54:44,506 --> 01:54:45,880
Why should I be afraid?

2018
01:54:45,881 --> 01:54:47,339
You're the ones
who should be trembling.

2019
01:54:48,047 --> 01:54:49,296
What do you think you're doing?

2020
01:54:49,297 --> 01:54:50,963
You know who's with me,
don't you?

2021
01:54:50,964 --> 01:54:52,671
Whoever it is,
tell him to step up!

2022
01:54:52,672 --> 01:54:54,421
Hey, this isn't our territory.

2023
01:54:54,422 --> 01:54:57,130
So what if this is just 'temporary'?
You're still here, aren't you?

2024
01:54:57,131 --> 01:54:59,005
- Come on! Do your worst!
- She's got a big mouth.

2025
01:54:59,006 --> 01:55:01,172
Bring it on!

2026
01:55:01,381 --> 01:55:02,755
I'm telling you,
this isn't my territory!

2027
01:55:02,756 --> 01:55:04,381
I have no powers out here!

2028
01:55:08,131 --> 01:55:09,347
That was a close shave!

2029
01:55:10,756 --> 01:55:11,278
Sir.

2030
01:55:11,797 --> 01:55:12,553
One minute!

2031
01:55:14,172 --> 01:55:15,171
What did you just say?

2032
01:55:15,172 --> 01:55:16,546
This is not part of my territory.

2033
01:55:16,547 --> 01:55:18,214
- What do you mean?
- Just reverse the car!

2034
01:55:19,047 --> 01:55:20,963
For every territory,
there will be a Guardian Deity.

2035
01:55:20,964 --> 01:55:22,713
Look! Can you see that arch?

2036
01:55:22,714 --> 01:55:24,256
That's our territory.

2037
01:55:27,422 --> 01:55:28,756
Go! Don't let them get away!

2038
01:55:35,006 --> 01:55:36,214
Sharp left! Now!

2039
01:55:55,006 --> 01:55:57,130
Is she an advocate
or actor Ajith Kumar?

2040
01:55:57,131 --> 01:55:58,464
Look at the way she's driving!

2041
01:56:09,047 --> 01:56:10,246
We're almost back in our territory!

2042
01:56:11,631 --> 01:56:13,547
Look, there's the arch!
Send the vehicle in!

2043
01:56:18,381 --> 01:56:19,547
Oh no! What do we do now?

2044
01:56:55,672 --> 01:56:57,547
Damn it! Run her over!

2045
01:57:03,714 --> 01:57:06,005
♪ He's a tiger that roars
like sudden thunder ♪

2046
01:57:06,006 --> 01:57:08,255
♪ He's the one who'll tear
your pride asunder ♪

2047
01:57:08,256 --> 01:57:10,547
♪ With fireworks raging,
burning in wrath ♪

2048
01:57:21,631 --> 01:57:23,506
♪ With steely defiance ♪

2049
01:57:23,881 --> 01:57:25,131
Wreck them, Saamy!

2050
01:57:25,797 --> 01:57:27,964
♪ Behold the God of Death
before you ♪

2051
01:57:28,089 --> 01:57:30,506
♪ Look, Death himself stands
in your view ♪

2052
01:57:30,631 --> 01:57:33,171
♪ At a single stare ♪

2053
01:57:33,172 --> 01:57:37,547
♪ You shatter and scatter
silently in the air ♪

2054
01:57:39,839 --> 01:57:42,255
♪ Even the Devil bowed and fled,
His arrogance torn and ripped to shreds ♪

2055
01:57:42,256 --> 01:57:44,505
♪ For He is the Ancient Ancestor,
The eternal, watchful protector ♪

2056
01:57:44,506 --> 01:57:48,256
♪ When this wild guardian strikes a blow,
It's your last goodbye, end of the show ♪

2057
01:57:48,672 --> 01:57:51,338
♪ Bullets splinter and spray,
The Hunter's roar leads the way ♪

2058
01:57:51,339 --> 01:57:53,588
♪ Hear Him and you'll scream and sway,
See Him, death joins the fray ♪

2059
01:57:53,589 --> 01:57:57,047
♪ Petty and small,
That's all you are, hey! ♪

2060
01:58:11,631 --> 01:58:13,921
♪ He's a tiger that roars
like sudden thunder ♪

2061
01:58:13,922 --> 01:58:16,171
♪ He's the one who'll tear
your pride asunder ♪

2062
01:58:16,172 --> 01:58:18,463
♪ With fireworks raging,
burning in wrath ♪

2063
01:58:18,464 --> 01:58:20,713
♪ Don't you dare stick your head
in the lion's jaws ♪

2064
01:58:20,714 --> 01:58:23,005
♪ He's a tiger that roars
like sudden thunder ♪

2065
01:58:23,006 --> 01:58:25,255
♪ He's the one who'll tear
your pride asunder ♪

2066
01:58:25,256 --> 01:58:27,547
♪ With fireworks raging,
burning in wrath ♪

2067
01:58:34,881 --> 01:58:35,881
I'm leaving.

2068
01:58:36,047 --> 01:58:37,880
I'm applying for a transfer
to another court.

2069
01:58:37,881 --> 01:58:39,880
You should leave too.
It's for the best.

2070
01:58:39,881 --> 01:58:41,755
My Lord, hear me out!
I have an idea.

2071
01:58:41,756 --> 01:58:43,005
Do you even have a brain?

2072
01:58:43,006 --> 01:58:44,963
Do you think I'm actor Karan
from those old devotional films?

2073
01:58:44,964 --> 01:58:47,172
Or Nizhalgal Ravi, to fight God
even after knowing who He is?

2074
01:58:48,214 --> 01:58:50,171
Oh no! Oh God!

2075
01:58:50,172 --> 01:58:51,881
God! God!
Forgive me, God!

2076
01:58:52,006 --> 01:58:53,630
I pointed the gun by mistake!
It's my own weapon!

2077
01:58:53,631 --> 01:58:55,797
- I have a license. I won't do it again--
- My Lord!

2078
01:58:56,714 --> 01:58:58,006
We're outside His territory now.

2079
01:58:58,172 --> 01:58:59,464
He has no power here.

2080
01:59:00,006 --> 01:59:01,588
Right? Now come on,
let's get to another court!

2081
01:59:01,589 --> 01:59:03,171
Staying alive is all
that matters, my dear!

2082
01:59:03,172 --> 01:59:05,671
If it were some Western God,
we could at least plead for mercy!

2083
01:59:05,672 --> 01:59:07,338
But this is Lord Karuppu!
Karuppanna Saamy!

2084
01:59:07,339 --> 01:59:09,088
He'll hack us to pieces
and grind our bones to dust!

2085
01:59:09,089 --> 01:59:10,546
Even after seeing that
God himself is here in the flesh...

2086
01:59:10,547 --> 01:59:12,046
you're still babbling
like a complete madman!

2087
01:59:12,047 --> 01:59:13,839
He appeared before me
six months ago.

2088
01:59:14,006 --> 01:59:15,381
Did I run away from the court?

2089
01:59:15,881 --> 01:59:16,611
Baby Kannan!

2090
01:59:17,381 --> 01:59:17,830
B...

2091
01:59:18,547 --> 01:59:20,047
Baby! That's it!

2092
01:59:20,589 --> 01:59:21,083
Convert!

2093
01:59:21,672 --> 01:59:22,671
Converted, right?

2094
01:59:22,672 --> 01:59:23,838
You are a convert, right?

2095
01:59:23,839 --> 01:59:26,421
That's why you have no fear...
no devotion in your soul!

2096
01:59:26,422 --> 01:59:27,838
What are you blabbering, My Lord!

2097
01:59:27,839 --> 01:59:29,339
Just listen to me for one minute!

2098
01:59:29,672 --> 01:59:31,256
God has power only
within his territory.

2099
01:59:32,797 --> 01:59:34,630
What if we move the court
beyond those limits?

2100
01:59:34,631 --> 01:59:36,922
Bravo! Shall we move it
during our lunch break then?

2101
01:59:38,006 --> 01:59:39,631
Psycho! Psycho! Psycho!

2102
01:59:40,006 --> 01:59:42,713
The roof above my chamber
could cave in at any moment!

2103
01:59:42,714 --> 01:59:44,755
I asked to fix it six months ago.
Nothing happened.

2104
01:59:44,756 --> 01:59:46,088
And you want to move
the entire court!

2105
01:59:46,089 --> 01:59:47,421
Stay here and rot for all I care!

2106
01:59:47,422 --> 01:59:49,381
Go and beg if you must,
I'm done with this!

2107
01:59:49,631 --> 01:59:50,631
I'm out of here!

2108
01:59:50,922 --> 01:59:51,621
Your Lordship!

2109
01:59:53,047 --> 01:59:55,131
Could you do me one small favour
before you go?

2110
02:00:08,756 --> 02:00:10,319
Perhaps no wrong
will happen in court now...

2111
02:00:10,756 --> 02:00:11,639
But accidents...
they are inevitable.

2112
02:00:11,922 --> 02:00:13,463
Such is the state of our court.

2113
02:00:13,464 --> 02:00:14,964
It's a 150-year-old court.

2114
02:00:15,381 --> 02:00:16,756
It could crumble at any moment.

2115
02:00:18,547 --> 02:00:20,047
It could explode at any moment.

2116
02:00:21,756 --> 02:00:22,964
We needn't lift a finger.

2117
02:00:23,464 --> 02:00:24,838
It will happen
of its own accord.

2118
02:00:24,839 --> 02:00:26,381
[Entry restricted
to 10 persons at a time]

2119
02:00:37,214 --> 02:00:39,631
"Isn't one hand enough, Sivagami?"

2120
02:01:19,006 --> 02:01:22,881
Sir!

2121
02:01:24,172 --> 02:01:24,782
Sir! Sir!

2122
02:01:28,922 --> 02:01:30,922
"What, you'll fix it only if it
falls on my head?"

2123
02:01:33,006 --> 02:01:34,006
Lordship!

2124
02:01:36,339 --> 02:01:38,006
Could you do me one small favour
before you go?

2125
02:01:46,464 --> 02:01:47,231
This is my domain!

2126
02:01:51,089 --> 02:01:51,808
My court!

2127
02:01:52,589 --> 02:01:53,921
If I leave this place...
where else would I go?

2128
02:01:53,922 --> 02:01:56,088
Every court in the land
has ten men just like me!

2129
02:01:56,089 --> 02:01:57,964
I can't start from scratch again.

2130
02:01:58,756 --> 02:02:01,631
Die, My Lord!
Die! Die! Die!

2131
02:02:13,547 --> 02:02:15,339
Make way! Make way! Make way!

2132
02:02:21,506 --> 02:02:25,005
Following the death of the Chief Judge
at the Seven Wells Court,

2133
02:02:25,006 --> 02:02:27,922
lawyers have launched
a large-scale protest.

2134
02:02:28,547 --> 02:02:31,797
We will protest until
this unsafe court is shifted!

2135
02:02:33,381 --> 02:02:34,672
We are the guardians of justice.

2136
02:02:35,006 --> 02:02:37,047
Yet here we are, forced to protest
for our own safety.

2137
02:02:38,047 --> 02:02:40,107
We can no longer function
in this court.

2138
02:02:40,672 --> 02:02:42,444
This court must be relocated
to a safe facility immediately.

2139
02:02:42,672 --> 02:02:44,256
Until then, our strike will continue.

2140
02:03:01,756 --> 02:03:05,463
The Seven Wells court protest has
intensified as it enters its seventh day.

2141
02:03:05,464 --> 02:03:08,796
The lawyers have declared that
they will continue the protest

2142
02:03:08,797 --> 02:03:10,756
until the government meets their demands.

2143
02:03:14,381 --> 02:03:17,588
Well, there was an accident in our court,
and we're protesting.

2144
02:03:17,589 --> 02:03:19,171
Why would the whole
town turn up for that?

2145
02:03:19,172 --> 02:03:20,339
Do you know what FOMO is?

2146
02:03:20,506 --> 02:03:22,297
- What?
- Fear Of Missing Out.

2147
02:03:22,714 --> 02:03:23,964
Even if it has
nothing to do with them,

2148
02:03:24,131 --> 02:03:25,631
everyone has an opinion
on everything these days.

2149
02:03:25,797 --> 02:03:27,381
Since it will be
new 'content' for them.

2150
02:03:27,881 --> 02:03:28,630
Just wait and watch.

2151
02:03:28,631 --> 02:03:30,588
This place you're seeing here
is Ezhu Kinaru.

2152
02:03:30,589 --> 02:03:34,213
In English, it's called Seven Wells.
In Korean, Ilgob-umul.

2153
02:03:34,214 --> 02:03:37,296
So guys, the whole town is buzzing
about the Seven Wells court accident.

2154
02:03:37,297 --> 02:03:40,381
But no one is talking about
the Burmese noodle shop right next to it!

2155
02:03:41,672 --> 02:03:45,963
Amid widespread support
for the lawyers' protest on social media,

2156
02:03:45,964 --> 02:03:49,380
opposition parties sparked an uproar
in the Tamil Nadu Legislative Assembly,

2157
02:03:49,381 --> 02:03:51,547
demanding the immediate relocation
of the court.

2158
02:03:51,672 --> 02:03:54,546
Consequently, the Seven Wells Court
will be temporarily shifted

2159
02:03:54,547 --> 02:03:55,963
to the IT Park in Sriperumbudur.

2160
02:03:55,964 --> 02:03:58,046
A formal resolution to this effect
has been passed

2161
02:03:58,047 --> 02:03:59,963
by the Tamil Nadu Legislative Assembly.

2162
02:03:59,964 --> 02:04:02,963
♪ This is our territory, if our fury takes flight,
You will meet your grave tonight ♪

2163
02:04:02,964 --> 02:04:05,922
♪ Non-stop blows if caught in our track,
We are built different, watch your back ♪

2164
02:04:37,172 --> 02:04:38,172
What happened, Anna?

2165
02:04:41,256 --> 02:04:42,797
Thirty years ago...

2166
02:04:43,297 --> 02:04:44,756
this was the case document I filed.

2167
02:04:45,839 --> 02:04:48,088
This is the only document
that still bears my name, Madam.

2168
02:04:48,089 --> 02:04:49,797
And now... even this
is of no use to anyone.

2169
02:04:50,047 --> 02:04:53,464
The wind just tossed it in my face...
along with the rest of the trash.

2170
02:04:54,464 --> 02:04:55,797
The court has been relocated.

2171
02:04:56,172 --> 02:04:57,463
The only place I ever belonged...

2172
02:04:57,464 --> 02:04:59,131
and my sole identity...
are both gone.

2173
02:05:01,422 --> 02:05:02,037
Trash!

2174
02:05:03,922 --> 02:05:04,657
It's nothing but trash!

2175
02:05:10,297 --> 02:05:11,297
It's all over.

2176
02:05:11,589 --> 02:05:13,505
He relocated the court
just the way he wanted.

2177
02:05:13,506 --> 02:05:16,049
You're the one who said everything
here is ancient and needs to change.

2178
02:05:16,672 --> 02:05:17,817
Does it really matter who changes it?

2179
02:05:18,339 --> 02:05:20,338
If everything becomes new,
that's a good thing, right?

2180
02:05:20,339 --> 02:05:21,381
Good for whom?

2181
02:05:21,756 --> 02:05:23,172
It's good for Baby Kannan.

2182
02:05:23,589 --> 02:05:25,839
He's going to seize control
of the court all over again.

2183
02:05:26,214 --> 02:05:28,381
Because the new court lies
well beyond your territory!

2184
02:05:49,089 --> 02:05:50,089
Super, Baby sir!

2185
02:06:13,464 --> 02:06:14,464
Good morning.

2186
02:06:15,964 --> 02:06:18,589
Our court resembles a Google
or Apple office now, doesn't it?

2187
02:06:18,881 --> 02:06:21,505
I am Soundara Pandian,
your new C.M.M.

2188
02:06:21,506 --> 02:06:23,213
Looking forward
to work with you all.

2189
02:06:23,214 --> 02:06:25,296
I'm afraid there isn't time
for individual introductions today.

2190
02:06:25,297 --> 02:06:27,172
He's on our side.
Everything's under control.

2191
02:06:27,381 --> 02:06:29,421
We have the court's inauguration
this evening, I believe?

2192
02:06:29,422 --> 02:06:30,756
We shall catch up then.

2193
02:06:30,964 --> 02:06:31,964
Proceed.

2194
02:06:32,714 --> 02:06:34,921
CC 2810.

2195
02:06:34,922 --> 02:06:36,422
V.M. Pandian

2196
02:06:36,631 --> 02:06:37,797
versus Kanmani.

2197
02:06:39,422 --> 02:06:41,172
In this case,
the trial has concluded.

2198
02:06:41,589 --> 02:06:42,881
Any closing arguments?

2199
02:06:43,006 --> 02:06:44,005
Baby Kannan?

2200
02:06:44,006 --> 02:06:46,964
My Lord, I have set out all my
important points in the written statement.

2201
02:06:48,131 --> 02:06:50,131
The crucial points
are on page five, My Lord!

2202
02:06:57,089 --> 02:06:58,296
Your closing argument?

2203
02:06:58,297 --> 02:07:00,922
My closing arguments are also
in the written statement, My Lord.

2204
02:07:02,381 --> 02:07:04,839
The crucial point is on page six, My Lord.

2205
02:07:46,964 --> 02:07:50,172
Upon consideration of the trial
and the closing arguments,

2206
02:07:51,131 --> 02:07:54,256
this Court finds that the accused,
Mr. V.M. Pandian,

2207
02:07:54,797 --> 02:07:57,046
has misbehaved
with the complainant, Ms. Kanmani,

2208
02:07:57,047 --> 02:07:59,506
and the same stands proved
beyond reasonable doubt.

2209
02:08:03,256 --> 02:08:05,421
Accordingly, under Section 75 of the BNS,

2210
02:08:05,422 --> 02:08:06,796
the accused, V.M. Pandian,

2211
02:08:06,797 --> 02:08:09,046
is hereby sentenced to three years
of rigorous imprisonment.

2212
02:08:09,047 --> 02:08:11,213
The complainant, Ms. Kanmani,

2213
02:08:11,214 --> 02:08:15,013
shall be entitled to compensation of
₹75 lakhs, to be paid by the accused.

2214
02:08:15,014 --> 02:08:16,667
Such is the order of this Court.

2215
02:08:18,464 --> 02:08:20,880
My Lord, I can provide a few
additional points if required.

2216
02:08:20,881 --> 02:08:22,338
- On page seven--
- Wait, Baby Kannan!

2217
02:08:22,339 --> 02:08:23,335
The judgement is not over yet.

2218
02:08:25,422 --> 02:08:29,006
For attempting to bribe
and influence this Court,

2219
02:08:29,422 --> 02:08:32,338
this Court directs the Registrar
and the Vigilance authorities

2220
02:08:32,339 --> 02:08:35,421
to initiate appropriate action
against Mr. Baby Kannan.

2221
02:08:35,422 --> 02:08:37,546
Furthermore, pending the completion
of the inquiry,

2222
02:08:37,547 --> 02:08:39,671
Mr. Baby Kannan shall be
suspended from legal practice,

2223
02:08:39,672 --> 02:08:41,144
as per our recommendation
to the Bar Council.

2224
02:08:42,422 --> 02:08:43,756
The Court is adjourned.

2225
02:08:50,047 --> 02:08:52,588
Hey, have you grown so powerful
that you can outbid me?

2226
02:08:52,589 --> 02:08:53,796
How much did you offer him?

2227
02:08:53,797 --> 02:08:54,839
Page number six!

2228
02:08:55,214 --> 02:08:57,297
How much do you think that is?
Still don't get it?

2229
02:08:58,089 --> 02:09:01,172
More important than knowing
the judge who pens the verdict,

2230
02:09:01,547 --> 02:09:04,005
is knowing that even above him,
there sits a higher power.

2231
02:09:04,006 --> 02:09:05,588
Go outside and see for yourself.

2232
02:09:05,589 --> 02:09:06,797
You'll understand.

2233
02:09:12,756 --> 02:09:15,880
♪ Don't you dare set foot into my cave,
One wrong step, you'll find your grave ♪

2234
02:09:15,881 --> 02:09:19,214
♪ If I take my spear and flay your skin,
You'll need a hot press to soothe within ♪

2235
02:09:19,506 --> 02:09:24,131
♪ You'll need a hot press ♪

2236
02:09:25,422 --> 02:09:26,422
Hey!!

2237
02:09:27,047 --> 02:09:30,089
If you think moving the court
lets you play your old games again...

2238
02:09:30,422 --> 02:09:31,756
He will be the end of you.

2239
02:09:32,381 --> 02:09:34,089
You'll choke on your own blood
and perish.

2240
02:09:34,339 --> 02:09:36,464
Every territory has its own
guardian deity.

2241
02:09:36,756 --> 02:09:38,130
And this territory... is His domain!

2242
02:09:38,131 --> 02:09:40,796
Karuppan, the Hunter,
punishes only when you do wrong...

2243
02:09:40,797 --> 02:09:42,380
But this one...
is far more ruthless than him.

2244
02:09:42,381 --> 02:09:43,796
Even a single thought of malice...

2245
02:09:43,797 --> 02:09:45,589
And your entire lineage will be
wiped out from its very roots!

2246
02:09:46,256 --> 02:09:48,839
In that territory, it was him.
In this territory, it is this One!

2247
02:09:48,964 --> 02:09:50,756
This is Karuppan,
the Guardian of this land.

2248
02:09:54,089 --> 02:09:55,171
Don't even think
of committing a sin.

2249
02:09:57,214 --> 02:09:59,880
They say, if a thumb is slit and
the forehead is marked with blood...

2250
02:09:59,881 --> 02:10:02,172
The guilty will spit blood and perish.

2251
02:10:03,381 --> 02:10:05,463
- Do they actually spit blood and die?
- Yes.

2252
02:10:05,464 --> 02:10:07,421
Oh God!

2253
02:10:07,422 --> 02:10:08,880
O Guardian Karuppa!

2254
02:10:08,881 --> 02:10:10,588
♪ He's a tiger that roars
like sudden thunder ♪

2255
02:10:10,589 --> 02:10:12,213
♪ He's the one who'll tear
your pride asunder ♪

2256
02:10:12,214 --> 02:10:15,255
♪ No more talk in my turf, silence is key,
My eyes alone will act, just wait and see ♪

2257
02:10:15,256 --> 02:10:16,963
♪ The drums resound
far and wide ♪

2258
02:10:16,964 --> 02:10:18,296
♪ Like thunderclaps
that crash and collide ♪

2259
02:10:18,297 --> 02:10:20,796
We have no power beyond the border.
What do we do now?

2260
02:10:20,797 --> 02:10:22,464
Power has its boundaries...

2261
02:10:22,964 --> 02:10:24,381
But fear travels everywhere.

2262
02:10:25,422 --> 02:10:28,130
♪ Persist and you'll be ground to bits,
Your bravado fades, you lose your wits ♪

2263
02:10:28,131 --> 02:10:30,588
♪ With steely defiance ♪

2264
02:10:30,589 --> 02:10:32,964
[Guardian Karuppu is watching]

2265
02:10:34,547 --> 02:10:36,922
♪ With steely defiance ♪

2266
02:10:41,672 --> 02:10:47,922
♪ All your pride will hit the floor ♪

2267
02:10:55,214 --> 02:10:57,172
We can no longer make a living
off lies here.

2268
02:10:57,381 --> 02:10:58,464
Leave us out of this.

2269
02:11:00,339 --> 02:11:02,005
My daughter can live
without her chain...

2270
02:11:02,006 --> 02:11:03,881
But I cannot live
without my head, sir.

2271
02:11:05,797 --> 02:11:08,297
What now? Are you going
to shift the court again?

2272
02:11:08,506 --> 02:11:10,547
Enough, Baby.
It's all over.

2273
02:11:11,547 --> 02:11:12,547
Baby!

2274
02:11:13,339 --> 02:11:14,422
My brother!

2275
02:11:26,589 --> 02:11:29,006
What happened, brother?
I hear your legal career is over?

2276
02:11:29,506 --> 02:11:31,921
That motor-mouth of yours...
it was your only asset, wasn't it?

2277
02:11:31,922 --> 02:11:33,172
What will you do now?

2278
02:11:33,506 --> 02:11:35,505
How about being an RJ
on the radio?

2279
02:11:35,506 --> 02:11:38,171
Or do you want to try your hand
at cricket commentary?

2280
02:11:38,172 --> 02:11:40,380
But for that, you'd actually
need to know cricket!

2281
02:11:40,381 --> 02:11:43,671
I know there's no God in this land...
and no power for him to wield here.

2282
02:11:43,672 --> 02:11:45,255
What if the people here
were to find that out?

2283
02:11:45,256 --> 02:11:46,921
How long can you run things
using nothing but fear?

2284
02:11:46,922 --> 02:11:49,381
You're just a little kid,
a total amateur!

2285
02:11:49,547 --> 02:11:51,839
If you've thought of it,
do you think I haven't already?

2286
02:11:52,214 --> 02:11:54,047
You're right.
This isn't my territory.

2287
02:11:54,922 --> 02:11:55,986
But the nature of this place...

2288
02:11:56,672 --> 02:11:57,639
The sheer power it holds...

2289
02:11:58,589 --> 02:12:00,046
What they're capable of here...

2290
02:12:00,047 --> 02:12:01,547
I only need
to show them a glimpse...

2291
02:12:01,672 --> 02:12:03,213
They'll handle the rest themselves.

2292
02:12:03,214 --> 02:12:04,783
After that, I don't have
to scare them anymore.

2293
02:12:05,131 --> 02:12:07,429
Even if your own father were to intervene,
he couldn't change a thing.

2294
02:12:08,464 --> 02:12:09,966
Because honesty is an addiction too.

2295
02:12:10,631 --> 02:12:12,005
Once you get a taste for it,
you will start to crave it.

2296
02:12:12,006 --> 02:12:13,422
After that...
there's no going back.

2297
02:12:13,797 --> 02:12:16,214
Hey, bro...
This is superb, man.

2298
02:12:16,506 --> 02:12:17,963
You've pulled this off brilliantly.

2299
02:12:17,964 --> 02:12:19,755
I was about to step in
and change everything myself.

2300
02:12:19,756 --> 02:12:21,338
But you've done an awesome job!

2301
02:12:21,339 --> 02:12:22,671
So the credit for this
doesn't go to me...

2302
02:12:22,672 --> 02:12:23,713
It's all yours.

2303
02:12:23,714 --> 02:12:25,505
I'm giving you one last chance.
Change your ways.

2304
02:12:25,506 --> 02:12:28,256
Or I'll sound the conch
for your final rites right here!

2305
02:12:36,131 --> 02:12:39,015
My greetings to everyone gathered here
for the inauguration of our new court.

2306
02:12:39,506 --> 02:12:42,422
Even a doctor who saves lives
is only said to be "like" God.

2307
02:12:42,547 --> 02:12:44,255
But when people step into the court,

2308
02:12:44,256 --> 02:12:47,088
they bow before us and say "My Lord,"
revering us as the Divine itself.

2309
02:12:47,089 --> 02:12:49,880
Yet, those who put their faith in us
find no swift justice.

2310
02:12:49,881 --> 02:12:51,131
They only find harassment.

2311
02:12:52,506 --> 02:12:54,506
But today, this institution
has transformed

2312
02:12:54,881 --> 02:12:57,046
into the very ideal
of what a court ought to be.

2313
02:12:57,047 --> 02:12:59,546
Whether it is through the fear of God...
or the weight of our own conscience...

2314
02:12:59,547 --> 02:13:02,006
we must not let this change fade.
It is our duty to protect it.

2315
02:13:34,214 --> 02:13:36,547
Hey, Baby! What now...
here to stir up trouble again?

2316
02:13:37,047 --> 02:13:37,727
Get out of here!

2317
02:13:40,964 --> 02:13:42,630
You think flashing a gun
will scare us?

2318
02:13:42,631 --> 02:13:44,297
We've seen all sorts of guns.

2319
02:13:45,256 --> 02:13:46,421
Hey! Hey! Hey!

2320
02:13:46,422 --> 02:13:48,421
Hey! Bolt the gate!
Don't let a single soul out!

2321
02:13:48,422 --> 02:13:49,506
Lock it down! Now!

2322
02:13:59,172 --> 02:14:01,296
Baby Kannan, stop committing
one sin after another

2323
02:14:01,297 --> 02:14:02,630
and attracting fresh cases.

2324
02:14:02,631 --> 02:14:04,297
Silence!

2325
02:14:05,381 --> 02:14:06,381
Don't open your mouth.

2326
02:14:07,047 --> 02:14:08,256
I am the judge here.

2327
02:14:11,381 --> 02:14:12,631
Hey, Thaniga?

2328
02:14:14,464 --> 02:14:16,422
You would rob
the bangles off a corpse...

2329
02:14:16,839 --> 02:14:18,088
and now you've
suddenly reformed?

2330
02:14:18,089 --> 02:14:20,256
But that mouth of yours...
can it ever stop lying?

2331
02:14:24,506 --> 02:14:25,276
Selvi Akka!

2332
02:14:26,172 --> 02:14:27,906
A sudden prick of conscience
and you've changed?

2333
02:14:28,172 --> 02:14:29,172
Tell me!

2334
02:14:29,464 --> 02:14:32,046
Can you drive your vehicle even for a day
without that "Advocate" sticker?

2335
02:14:32,047 --> 02:14:33,089
Huh?

2336
02:14:33,422 --> 02:14:35,088
Because of Go... God, sir.

2337
02:14:35,089 --> 02:14:36,131
Yes!

2338
02:14:36,422 --> 02:14:37,422
God!

2339
02:14:38,172 --> 02:14:39,464
Point may be noted.

2340
02:14:39,839 --> 02:14:40,964
So... you haven't reformed.

2341
02:14:41,881 --> 02:14:43,089
None of you have reformed.

2342
02:14:44,797 --> 02:14:45,881
It is nothing but fear...

2343
02:14:46,589 --> 02:14:48,922
Fear that you'll spit blood
and perish the moment you sin.

2344
02:14:50,047 --> 02:14:52,380
But look at me, I'm committing
one sin after another right now!

2345
02:14:52,381 --> 02:14:53,671
And yet, no God has shown up.

2346
02:14:53,672 --> 02:14:55,380
- I haven't died spitting blood yet.
- Baby!

2347
02:14:55,381 --> 02:14:56,381
- Let it go, Baby!
- What?

2348
02:14:56,839 --> 02:14:57,839
Don't do this, Baby.

2349
02:14:58,006 --> 02:15:00,005
If the police arrive,
this will turn into a criminal case.

2350
02:15:00,006 --> 02:15:01,464
CC 2223!

2351
02:15:03,381 --> 02:15:06,214
For all these petty sins...
won't God show up? Only the police will?

2352
02:15:07,422 --> 02:15:10,589
Then should I keep committing more,
until God finally appears? Shall I?

2353
02:15:12,089 --> 02:15:13,131
Hey!

2354
02:15:17,297 --> 02:15:18,547
Don't move!

2355
02:15:19,006 --> 02:15:20,380
Oh no! My wedding necklace!

2356
02:15:20,381 --> 02:15:22,047
Oh no! My chain!

2357
02:15:32,631 --> 02:15:35,089
Violence, assault, harassment...
Violation of the Arms Act.

2358
02:15:36,131 --> 02:15:37,131
I've done it all now.

2359
02:15:37,631 --> 02:15:38,964
The next step... murder.

2360
02:15:40,422 --> 02:15:41,492
Where is your God now?

2361
02:16:15,547 --> 02:16:18,880
[theme from "Singam"]
♪ Everybody, listen, listen, listen ♪

2362
02:16:18,881 --> 02:16:22,172
♪ Just watch the way
He's gonna swing... alright ♪

2363
02:16:25,381 --> 02:16:26,381
Hey!

2364
02:16:26,672 --> 02:16:28,672
Who is this making
such a thunderous entrance?

2365
02:16:40,797 --> 02:16:42,131
So you're a cop...

2366
02:16:42,256 --> 02:16:44,338
Does that make you
some kind of hotshot?

2367
02:16:44,339 --> 02:16:45,881
♪ He's Dorai Singam ♪

2368
02:16:48,714 --> 02:16:52,339
♪ Just his walk shakes the ground,
And makes the earth itself bow down ♪

2369
02:16:54,089 --> 02:16:55,921
♪ Lord Karuppan arrives,
don't block his path ♪

2370
02:16:55,922 --> 02:16:59,464
♪ Singam, Singam,
He's Dorai Singam ♪

2371
02:17:02,131 --> 02:17:06,214
♪ All five elements in him reside,
Bound together deep inside ♪

2372
02:17:22,172 --> 02:17:23,129
Brother, B.K.!

2373
02:17:24,131 --> 02:17:27,006
A gun ends up in your hand,
and you'll aim it at just anyone?

2374
02:17:27,756 --> 02:17:28,838
Oh my!

2375
02:17:28,839 --> 02:17:29,771
Singam!

2376
02:17:30,756 --> 02:17:31,756
Re-entry, huh?

2377
02:17:32,297 --> 02:17:34,131
But this isn't your territory...
it's mine!

2378
02:17:34,297 --> 02:17:35,339
This is my court!

2379
02:17:35,464 --> 02:17:36,464
Attack!

2380
02:18:09,839 --> 02:18:11,130
I'd been away for just a while...

2381
02:18:11,131 --> 02:18:12,506
♪ This is God mode ♪

2382
02:18:12,631 --> 02:18:14,047
...and you dared
to forget who I am?

2383
02:18:14,422 --> 02:18:16,672
♪ This is God mode ♪

2384
02:18:17,839 --> 02:18:19,796
♪ This is God Mode ♪

2385
02:18:19,797 --> 02:18:21,630
♪ The sound will forever explode ♪

2386
02:18:21,631 --> 02:18:29,546
♪ The shores blaze bright, masses unite,
Scream my name in roaring might ♪

2387
02:18:29,547 --> 02:18:31,464
Every territory has its own
Lord Karuppu.

2388
02:18:31,714 --> 02:18:33,506
And he's the Lord Karuppu
of this territory!

2389
02:18:39,881 --> 02:18:41,839
The One who has arrived...
is no mere policeman.

2390
02:18:43,464 --> 02:18:44,589
The Guardian!

2391
02:18:47,256 --> 02:18:49,589
Guardian Karuppu!
Lord Karuppa!!!

2392
02:18:54,464 --> 02:18:56,945
So many Gods... just to bring down
one Baby Kannan in a single court?

2393
02:18:57,631 --> 02:18:59,024
There are thousands
of courts out there.

2394
02:19:00,297 --> 02:19:01,839
And thousands of Baby Kannans.

2395
02:19:02,506 --> 02:19:04,214
How many Gods will descend
for all of them?

2396
02:19:06,756 --> 02:19:08,521
You cannot change anything here
by going against us.

2397
02:19:09,172 --> 02:19:10,280
Try and change it...
if you dare!

2398
02:19:23,131 --> 02:19:24,672
So, you are beyond redemption.

2399
02:20:03,547 --> 02:20:09,922
♪ One who stands tall and mighty,
upon the eighteenth step, O Karuppa ♪

2400
02:20:10,214 --> 02:20:13,838
♪ Behold, Karuppan arrives ♪

2401
02:20:13,839 --> 02:20:17,421
♪ The fierce Karuppan emerges ♪

2402
02:20:17,422 --> 02:20:21,046
♪ Behold, Karuppan arrives ♪

2403
02:20:21,047 --> 02:20:24,046
♪ The fierce Karuppan emerges ♪

2404
02:20:24,047 --> 02:20:25,088
Lord Karuppa!

2405
02:20:25,089 --> 02:20:28,963
♪ Ascending the fourth step,
He'll sever your life-veins away ♪

2406
02:20:28,964 --> 02:20:32,796
♪ Ascending the sixth step,
He throws your frame astray ♪

2407
02:20:32,797 --> 02:20:36,505
♪ Ascending the eighth step,
He burns the deceiver to ash ♪

2408
02:20:36,506 --> 02:20:41,130
♪ Ascending the tenth step,
all sins are washed in a flash ♪

2409
02:20:41,131 --> 02:20:46,546
♪ Lightning on lightning,
demons fall ♪

2410
02:20:46,547 --> 02:20:51,547
♪ Ascending the eighteenth step,
He guards us all ♪

2411
02:20:54,797 --> 02:20:57,214
Lord Karuppa!

2412
02:21:02,339 --> 02:21:04,421
♪ He stands, the world and flesh
both scream in fear ♪

2413
02:21:04,422 --> 02:21:06,922
♪ With blazing eyes,
in raging wrath He's here ♪

2414
02:21:08,047 --> 02:21:09,921
♪ He stands to rip the gut
and tear it clear ♪

2415
02:21:09,922 --> 02:21:12,214
♪ He stands to drink the blood
and draw it near ♪

2416
02:21:13,297 --> 02:21:15,338
♪ Let every mighty man
stay far from here ♪

2417
02:21:15,339 --> 02:21:17,172
♪ None have escaped
Karuppan's burning stare ♪

2418
02:21:18,714 --> 02:21:20,296
♪ His punishment alone
is truth severe ♪

2419
02:21:20,297 --> 02:21:23,838
♪ Behold, Karuppan arrives ♪

2420
02:21:23,839 --> 02:21:27,505
♪ The fierce Karuppan emerges ♪

2421
02:21:27,506 --> 02:21:31,130
♪ Behold, Karuppan arrives ♪

