2427
02:21:42,839 --> 02:21:44,546
♪ The Guardian,
the Furious One ♪

2428
02:21:44,547 --> 02:21:46,505
♪ The Hunter with his wild
tongue sprung ♪

2429
02:21:46,506 --> 02:21:49,921
