2433
02:22:00,756 --> 02:22:04,006
♪ Karuppan will stand
beside you as your own ♪

2434
02:22:04,214 --> 02:22:05,921
♪ As the sacred silk
crowns His head ♪

2435
02:22:05,922 --> 02:22:07,546
♪ With sandal and power
