2437
02:22:08,922 --> 02:22:10,505
♪ With rolling eyes
that burn with dread ♪

2438
02:22:10,506 --> 02:22:15,131
♪ O Lord Karuppan ♪

2439
02:22:15,881 --> 02:22:19,255
