02:23:05,381 --> 02:23:08,380
♪ Lord Karuppa, manifest thy power ♪

2450
02:23:08,381 --> 02:23:11,255
♪ Bestow Thy presence upon us ♪

2451
02:23:11,256 --> 02:23:14,255
♪ Lord Karuppa, manifest thy power ♪

2452
