♪ Bestow Thy presence upon us ♪

2453
02:23:25,839 --> 02:23:28,588
People come to courts seeking justice,
venerating you as living Gods.

2454
02:23:28,589 --> 02:23:30,589
Do not cast them out
to languish at temple gates.

2455
02:23:30,714 --> 02:23:32,672
For if you leave them waiting there...

2456
02:23:34,464 --> 02:23:36,547
If you leave them waiting there...

2457
02:23:51,964 --> 02:23:55,171
♪ Lord Karuppa, manifest thy power ♪

2458
02:23:55,172 --> 02:23:58,213
♪ Bestow Thy presence upon us ♪

2459
02:23:58,214 --> 02:24:01,213
♪ Lord Karuppa, manifest thy power ♪

2460
02:24:01,214 --> 02:24:04,797
♪ Bestow Thy presence upon us ♪

2461
02:24:10,464 --> 02:24:12,131
I have taken up
this case suo motu.

2462
02:24:13,131 --> 02:24:15,464
Because this is a case
that concerns all of us.

2463
02:24:15,672 --> 02:24:17,005
Did you see him... our "Ghost"?

2464
02:24:17,006 --> 02:24:19,214
A haircut and a shave...
and he's a brand-new person.

2465
02:24:19,381 --> 02:24:21,714
The maximum punishment
prescribed for a brutal murder...

2466
02:24:22,172 --> 02:24:23,797
is double imprisonment.
28 years.

2467
02:24:24,006 --> 02:24:26,421
Yet, a man who came before this Court
to prove he was alive...

2468
02:24:26,422 --> 02:24:29,213
was punished for 30 years, as though
this Court itself were a prison.

2469
02:24:29,214 --> 02:24:30,796
Had we seen this man,
who was right before our eyes...

2470
02:24:30,797 --> 02:24:32,755
as a human being
rather than a ghost...

2471
02:24:32,756 --> 02:24:34,165
he would have received
justice long ago.

2472
02:24:34,922 --> 02:24:36,588
Throughout the years
you spent within these walls,

2473
02:24:36,589 --> 02:24:37,425
the failure was never yours.

2474
02:24:38,006 --> 02:24:40,422
It is we, the judicial community...
who have failed you.

2475
02:24:40,672 --> 02:24:42,464
Today, this Court seeks this
opportunity to rectify that failure.

2476
02:24:43,214 --> 02:24:44,611
From this moment forth,
you are no longer a 'ghost.'

2477
02:24:45,172 --> 02:24:46,714
His name is Shanmugam.

2478
02:24:47,881 --> 02:24:49,297
We are sorry, Mr. Shanmugam.

2479
02:24:55,339 --> 02:24:56,631
Congratulations, Shanmugam!

2480
02:24:57,339 --> 02:25:00,339
Shanmugam, congratulations!

2481
02:25:02,672 --> 02:25:03,874
Congratulations, Shanmugam!

2482
02:25:06,131 --> 02:25:07,130
Yes!

2483
02:25:07,131 --> 02:25:08,297
Super!

2484
02:25:17,256 --> 02:25:18,338
This...

2485
02:25:18,339 --> 02:25:19,267
is our court.

2486
02:25:20,256 --> 02:25:21,434
Look into his eyes.

2487
02:25:22,547 --> 02:25:24,395
The relief that justice
has finally been served.

2488
02:25:26,297 --> 02:25:27,850
That slight glimmer of pride
at having triumphed.

2489
02:25:29,297 --> 02:25:31,131
A newfound hope for the future.

2490
02:25:31,672 --> 02:25:34,588
The only place that can
grant all these emotions equally,

2491
02:25:34,589 --> 02:25:38,588
even to those without wealth,
status, or education...

2492
02:25:38,589 --> 02:25:39,375
is this Court.

2493
02:25:39,922 --> 02:25:42,339
What is this place?
What power does it truly hold?

2494
02:25:42,589 --> 02:25:45,422
When the world finally grasps
what this place is capable of...

2495
02:25:46,089 --> 02:25:48,672
then, you may find those
who have no faith in God here.

2496
02:25:48,922 --> 02:25:52,089
But you will not find a single soul...
who lacks faith in the Court.

2497
02:26:03,672 --> 02:26:04,388
Just a minute.

2498
02:26:14,672 --> 02:26:16,131
Do you know what I really wish for?

2499
02:26:16,631 --> 02:26:17,630
Just once,

2500
02:26:17,631 --> 02:26:18,671
with my dad,

2501
02:26:18,672 --> 02:26:20,881
I just want to sit there
and eat a biryani in peace.

2502
02:27:01,922 --> 02:27:07,547
The shortage of judges, millions of pending
cases, and the need for modernisation...

2503
02:27:07,714 --> 02:27:10,089
To address these critical
demands of the judiciary,

2504
02:27:10,214 --> 02:27:12,381
the Tamil Nadu Legislative
Assembly convenes today.

2505
02:27:12,714 --> 02:27:15,588
You say God appeared in some
court and everything changed!

2506
02:27:15,589 --> 02:27:18,589
But will He visit every court?
The work is up to us!

2507
02:27:18,964 --> 02:27:22,088
Judges and lawyers have made a request
seeking a solution to all these issues.

2508
02:27:22,089 --> 02:27:23,296
As the opposition,

2509
02:27:23,297 --> 02:27:25,880
we demand that the government
fulfil their request immediately.

2510
02:27:25,881 --> 02:27:28,296
We demand it! We demand it!

2511
02:27:28,297 --> 02:27:29,797
Silence! Silence!

2512
02:27:30,422 --> 02:27:31,713
Please stop!

2513
02:27:31,714 --> 02:27:33,255
All the questions you've raised

2514
02:27:33,256 --> 02:27:36,589
will be answered by the Honourable
Law Minister on behalf of the government.

2515
02:27:42,714 --> 02:27:43,796
Forgive me!

2516
02:27:43,797 --> 02:27:45,131
You shall have your answer from

2517
02:27:45,297 --> 02:27:47,089
the pulse that leads the party's march,

2518
02:27:47,839 --> 02:27:49,338
the poor man's torch,

2519
02:27:49,339 --> 02:27:51,088
Patek Philippe watch,

2520
02:27:51,089 --> 02:27:52,546
priceless Scotch,

2521
02:27:52,547 --> 02:27:55,005
the permanent Chief Minister
of Tamil Nadu,

2522
02:27:55,006 --> 02:27:58,256
Dr. Usilampatti Karuppaiah Gandhi!

2523
02:28:12,756 --> 02:28:14,214
Honourable Speaker!

2524
02:28:14,339 --> 02:28:16,796
Wondering how I'd save
Tamil Nadu all by myself,

2525
02:28:16,797 --> 02:28:18,214
I've had many sleepless nights.

2526
02:28:18,589 --> 02:28:21,381
But seeing the opposition's
concern for the people...

2527
02:28:21,672 --> 02:28:23,381
I'm inspired to save Tamil Nadu!

2528
02:28:26,422 --> 02:28:28,297
From 1958 till date,

2529
02:28:28,547 --> 02:28:30,338
the Law Commission has
been formed 8 times!

2530
02:28:30,339 --> 02:28:32,088
But no government,
state or central,

2531
02:28:32,089 --> 02:28:34,630
has met the judiciary's demands.

2532
02:28:34,631 --> 02:28:36,005
It remains "under consideration."

2533
02:28:36,006 --> 02:28:36,881
Why?
Because...

2534
02:28:37,589 --> 02:28:40,631
From selling gutkha to kidney theft,
protest shootings and lock-up murders,

2535
02:28:40,797 --> 02:28:43,588
out of 234 people in this room,

2536
02:28:43,589 --> 02:28:45,297
170 are facing criminal charges.

2537
02:28:45,631 --> 02:28:48,256
If we give the courts what they want,
we won't be sitting in here.

2538
02:28:48,922 --> 02:28:50,046
We'll be behind bars!

2539
02:28:50,047 --> 02:28:52,796
We must drown the courts
in mountains of case files.

2540
02:28:52,797 --> 02:28:54,796
Keep them gasping for air,
buried under endless problems.

2541
02:28:54,797 --> 02:28:56,756
That's how we keep them
from messing with us.

2542
02:28:57,631 --> 02:29:00,256
What's more important, the public good
or us remaining in power?

2543
02:29:01,256 --> 02:29:04,005
So, about fulfilling
the judiciary's demands,

2544
02:29:04,006 --> 02:29:05,921
