Honourable Speaker?

2545
02:29:05,922 --> 02:29:08,756
Members may express
their views by voting.

2546
02:29:16,339 --> 02:29:18,422
The vote is 233 to 1.

2547
02:29:20,589 --> 02:29:21,589
Not bad!

2548
02:29:22,172 --> 02:29:25,005
Even the opposition
has joined us for a good cause!

2549
